  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Give Healthy Meals to Disabled Romanian Orphans</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">At our Delia&apos;s Learning Center for underserved, special needs children we will continue to provide healthy meals to kids who have physical, developmental, and cognitive disabilities including autism. Many of our kids live in rural villages, without refrigeration or running water. Our goal is to improve physical well-being and positively impact academic success through proper nutrition. We aim to serve 4,000 meals to 40 kids attending our Center in one of the poorest areas of the E.U.</narrative>
  </description>
